 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "root",
   "x": 197,
   "y": 10,
   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "High glucose: is it DIABETES, and WHICH TYPE?",
   "lines": [
    "the same cut-offs for type 1 and type 2: they mark where RETINOPATHY risk rises",
    "symptoms (thirst, polyuria, weight loss) → ONE abnormal test is enough · none → repeat on ANOTHER day",
    "acutely ill (heart attack, sepsis, high-dose steroids) → suspect, confirm once recovered"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_below",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 156,
   "w": 512,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "BELOW the line: NOT YET diabetes",
   "lines": [
    "grey zone: fasting 6.1–6.9 · 2-h 75 g 7.8–11.0 mmol/L · glycated hemoglobin (A1c) 6.0–6.4%"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_dm",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 156,
   "w": 512,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "AT or ABOVE the line: DIABETES",
   "lines": [
    "ANY ONE: fasting ≥ 7.0 · 2-h 75 g or random ≥ 11.1 mmol/L · A1c ≥ 6.5% (adults, NOT if type 1 is suspected)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_type",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 274,
   "w": 512,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "WHICH TYPE? Usually time and the response to treatment tell",
   "lines": [
    "still unsure → C-peptide (is she making insulin?) + anti-glutamic acid decarboxylase (anti-GAD) antibodies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pre_head_0_0",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 432,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 132,
   "kind": "pre_h",
   "title": "Prediabetes",
   "lines": [
    "impaired fasting glucose (IFG) or impaired glucose tolerance (IGT)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_head_0_0",
   "x": 307,
   "y": 432,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 132,
   "kind": "t1e_h",
   "title": "Type 1, stages 1–2",
   "lines": [
    "beta-cell autoimmunity, NO symptoms yet",
    "autoantibodies in up to 85%: insulin, GAD (most specific, 70%), IA-2, zinc transporter 8"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_head_0_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 432,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 132,
   "kind": "t1_h",
   "title": "Type 1: new onset (stage 3)",
   "lines": [
    "autoimmune beta-cell loss → ABSOLUTE insulin deficiency",
    "alpha cells SPARED · 'starvation': glycogenolysis + gluconeogenesis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_head_0_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 432,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 132,
   "kind": "t2_h",
   "title": "Type 2",
   "lines": [
    "insulin RESISTANCE + RELATIVE deficiency: both present by diagnosis",
    "> 90% of all diabetes · no autoantibodies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pre_pres_0_0",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 604,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 336,
   "kind": "pre_t",
   "title": "No symptoms",
   "lines": [
    "type 2 can sit here for YEARS first"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_pres_0_0",
   "x": 307,
   "y": 604,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 336,
   "kind": "t1e_t",
   "title": "Often a relative with type 1",
   "lines": [
    "• identical twin 50%",
    "• sibling 5% (no family: 0.4%)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_pres_0_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 604,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 98,
   "kind": "t1_t",
   "title": "ACUTE: polyuria, thirst, weight LOSS",
   "lines": [
    "• new bed-wetting, nocturia",
    "• appetite unchanged"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_pres_1_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 724,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 98,
   "kind": "bad",
   "title": "Vomiting · abdominal pain · fast breathing · drowsy",
   "lines": [
    "→ diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA): see the COMPLICATIONS chart"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_pres_2_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 844,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 96,
   "kind": "t1_t",
   "title": "Exam",
   "lines": [
    "• hydration · weight loss · consciousness",
    "• Kussmaul breathing · acetone breath"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_pres_0_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 604,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 112,
   "kind": "t2_t",
   "title": "SLOW: years in the grey zone",
   "lines": [
    "• few or no symptoms",
    "• recent weight GAIN, or stopped exercising"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_pres_1_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 738,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 202,
   "kind": "t2_w",
   "title": "Risk",
   "lines": [
    "• parent with type 2, previous gestational diabetes",
    "• Asian, South Asian, Hispanic, Indigenous, African descent",
    "• identical twin 90% (type 1: 50%) · 40% have an affected parent",
    "• birth-weight extremes · high glucose in utero"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pre_inv_0_0",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 980,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 298,
   "kind": "pre_w",
   "title": "1 · Look for metabolic syndrome",
   "lines": [
    "• high blood pressure",
    "• low high-density lipoprotein (HDL), high triglycerides",
    "• waist-to-hip ratio ↑ (visceral fat)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_inv_0_0",
   "x": 307,
   "y": 980,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 98,
   "kind": "t1e_w",
   "title": "1 · COUNT the islet autoantibodies",
   "lines": [
    "• 1 alone: no added risk",
    "• 2: 25% in 5 years · 3: 40%"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_inv_1_0",
   "x": 307.0,
   "y": 1100,
   "w": 120.0,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "t1e_w",
   "title": "Stage 1",
   "lines": [
    "glucose NORMAL"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_inv_1_1",
   "x": 437.0,
   "y": 1100,
   "w": 120.0,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "t1e_w",
   "title": "Stage 2",
   "lines": [
    "glucose in the GREY ZONE"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_inv_2_0",
   "x": 307,
   "y": 1200,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "t1e_w",
   "title": "case: sibling with type 1",
   "lines": [
    "anti-GAD + anti-insulin · fasting 6.5 → STAGE 2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_inv_0_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 980,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 101,
   "kind": "t1_t",
   "title": "1 · Random glucose ≥ 11.1",
   "lines": [
    "+ urine dipstick: glucose AND ketones",
    "case: 8-year-old · random 18.9 · urine glucose ++, ketones +"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_inv_1_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 1103,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 67,
   "kind": "t1_w",
   "title": "2 · C-peptide · blood gas if DKA suspected",
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_inv_2_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 1192,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 85,
   "kind": "t1_w",
   "title": "Fasting glucose, A1c: usually unnecessary",
   "lines": [
    "A1c is NOT a type 1 criterion"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_inv_0_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 980,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 111,
   "kind": "t2_t",
   "title": "1 · Few symptoms → REPEAT the test",
   "lines": [
    "on another day"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_inv_1_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 1113,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 165,
   "kind": "t2_w",
   "title": "2 · Metabolic syndrome as well?",
   "lines": [
    "→ even higher cardiovascular risk",
    "• triglycerides ↑, HDL ↓, small dense LDL",
    "• also ask about sleep apnea"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pre_tx_0_0",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 1318,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 498,
   "kind": "ok",
   "title": "The TARGET for prevention",
   "lines": [
    "see the PREVENTION OF TYPE 2 DIABETES chart"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_tx_0_0",
   "x": 307,
   "y": 1318,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 498,
   "kind": "warn",
   "title": "Stage 3 = SYMPTOMS",
   "lines": [
    "→ treat as new-onset type 1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_tx_0_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 1318,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 168,
   "kind": "ok",
   "title": "1 · INSULIN: basal + bolus",
   "lines": [
    "• 3/day: intermediate (NPH) + fast-acting",
    "• 4/day: long-acting + fast-acting, or a pump",
    "• units/kg/day: onset < 0.5 · pre-puberty 0.7–1.0 · puberty 1.0–2.0",
    "~lows: see the COMPLICATIONS chart"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_tx_1_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 1508,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 170,
   "kind": "ok",
   "title": "2 · Teach: a multidisciplinary team",
   "lines": [
    "• glucose 4×/day, every 2–3 h when ill",
    "• carbohydrate counting",
    "• pumps, continuous glucose monitors",
    "• under 18: fasting 4–8 · after meals 5–10 · A1c < 7.5%",
    "• annual urine albumin"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_tx_2_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 1700,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 116,
   "kind": "warn",
   "title": "Intensive insulin (DCCT): A1c 7% vs 9%",
   "lines": [
    "• microvascular complications ↓",
    "• but HYPOGLYCEMIA ↑ (pumps, monitors offset it)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_tx_0_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 1318,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 238,
   "kind": "ok",
   "title": "1 · Weight, activity, diet",
   "lines": [
    "glucose can fall BELOW the line → recheck periodically"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_tx_1_0",
